   "text": "You gave him the penalty in his last home game. He scored it, just. He says it's the only goal of his he remembers."
  },
  {
   "id": "kept-his-secret",
   "title": "Kept it",
   "text": "He told you first that it was his last season, and you told nobody. He told the dressing room himself, in May, and looked at you while he did."
  },
  {
   "id": "the-leak",
   "title": "It got out",
   "text": "His last season got into the papers before he could tell anyone. He knows it wasn't you. He doesn't know for sure."
  }
